 ## Background
-The method was introduced by Comba et al. in 2000 as part of an approximate volume rendering technique for curvilinear and unstructured grids using hardware-assisted polyhedron projection [S1]. It addresses the limitations of projecting non-planar quadrilaterals directly, which can lead to incorrect visibility sorting due to self-intersections or multiple ray intersections [S1]. The approach builds on the BSP-XMPVO sorting algorithm [S1].
